      "writtenOn": "2026-10-06T07:53:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Regex aren\u0027t supported at the moment.\n\nWe don\u0027t handle regexes in this security fix, but the code accepts any Gerrit query string, including regex, so they can be inserted.\n\nWhen they do, we silently compare the operand literally, build the change anyway, and open a security bypass.\n\nIf regexes are unsupported, should we reject them rather than let the change through anyway?",
